        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你看出来了。表面上是做教育、做公益，本质上是在跑马圈地。AI这个东西最贵的是什么？不是显卡，不是电费，是人才。北美那边的人才竞争已经白热化了，成本高得离谱。新兴市场的人才红利才刚刚开始释放。",
      "start": 443.047,
      "duration": 17.042,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以全球AI人才的重心是在往下沉？",
      "start": 460.57,
      "duration": 4.136,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，你看这几年印度、印尼、越南、尼日利亚这些地方的AI开发者社区增长非常快。这不是偶然，是巨头们在有意引导。谁先把当地的开发者生态建起来，未来十年谁就掌握了主动权。",
      "start": 465.132,
      "duration": 15.17,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_042_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那对咱们国内的开发者来说，有什么启示吗？",
      "start": 480.772,
      "duration": 4.223,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_043_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我觉得吧，机会肯定是有的，但竞争也激烈了。以前咱们可能只需要跟硅谷、印度PK，现在东南亚、非洲这些地方也在崛起。但反过来想，咱们的优势是产业链完整、应用场景丰富，这些是别人短期内学不来的。",
      "start": 485.456,
      "duration": 16.085,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_044_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_044_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，这个判断挺客观的。对了，还有一条Gemini API升级的消息，你关注了吗？",
      "start": 501.997,
      "duration": 7.14,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_045_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_045_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "看到了。托管智能体升级到了3.6 Flash版本，还新增了Hooks和Triggers这些开发者钩子能力。",
      "start": 509.603,
      "duration": 8.664,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_046_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_046_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "\"开发者钩子\"这名字听着挺玄乎的，到底是干嘛用的？",
      "start": 518.7,
      "duration": 5.094,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_047_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_047_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个特别重要。简单来说，Hooks就是允许开发者在智能体的特定执行节点上注入自定义逻辑，比如在模型调用前后做一些数据处理、日志记录、合规检查之类的。Triggers就更直接了，是基于事件触发的，比如新邮件来了、订单状态变了，自动启动某个智能体流程。",
      "start": 524.201,
      "duration": 22.006,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_048_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_048_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这不就是给AI智能体装上了\"手脚\"嘛？",
      "start": 546.677,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_049_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_049_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个比喻挺准的。以前AI模型像个孤岛，你问它问题它回答你，问完了就完了。但有了Hooks和Triggers，AI就能嵌入到业务流程里去了。这是Agent走向成熟的关键一步，也是谷歌在企业市场跟其他玩家竞争的重要筹码。",
      "start": 551.998,
      "duration": 18.585,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_050_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_050_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我突然有个想法啊，你说如果把这些能力都结合起来——GLM-5.3的开源能力、Gemini的托管智能体、新兴市场的人才红利——是不是意味着我们正站在一个AI应用大爆发的临界点上？",
      "start": 570.994,
      "duration": 16.215,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_051_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_051_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "临界点这个说法我同意一半。技术上确实是到了，但商业上能不能跑通，还得看具体的落地场景。这就好比移动互联网当年技术成熟了，但真正赚钱的是那些找到具体场景的产品。技术是必要条件，不是充分条件。",
      "start": 587.701,
      "duration": 17.26,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_052_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_052_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以说到底，还是得回到\"AI到底解决了什么具体问题\"这个本原问题上来。",
      "start": 605.412,
      "duration": 7.053,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_053_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_053_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对。任何脱离实际应用的技术炫技，最后都会被市场教育。这个规律在每一波技术浪潮里都反复上演。",
      "start": 612.955,
      "duration": 8.751,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_054_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_054_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航，今天聊完这些新闻，我最大的感受就是——AI这个领域的变化速度真的超出想象。年初我们还在讨论某个模型是不是超过了某个基准，年底就已经是几代技术更迭了。",
      "start": 622.206,
      "duration": 13.646,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_055_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_055_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是，而且更深层的变化不在技术本身，而在整个产业格局的重构。从谷歌肢解DeepMind到GLM-5.3的突围，从新兴市场的人才下沉到Gemini API的能力升级，你会发现AI的\"游戏规则\"正在被快速改写。今天谁能说自己是绝对领先，那都是暂时的。",
      "start": 636.337,
      "duration": 21.396,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_056_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_056_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，咱们作为观察者和记录者，能做的就是把这些变化及时传递给大家。",
      "start": 658.213,
      "duration": 6.574,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_057_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_057_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "也希望咱们国内的开发者和创业者能从这些全球动态中找到自己的机会。看清大势，不盲目跟风，也不轻易掉队。",
      "start": 665.187,
      "duration": 9.143,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_058_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_058_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "好的，那今天的节目就到这里。听众朋友们如果觉得节目有意思，欢迎在评论区告诉我们你最关注的AI新闻。咱们下期再见。",
      "start": 674.808,
